      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:虽然由此PROMISED BLOOD被逼入了绝境，]@[textBlack:但这也成为了让我们得知]@[textBlack:渴望着“变回名为Eve的魔女”的][textYellow:心魔][textBlack:们的]@[textBlack:真正目的的契机。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102801/vo_full_102801-1-2"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:我们由这一真正目的明白了]@[textYellow:心魔][textBlack:们将各个团体的成员减少到12人]@[textBlack:让其他的魔法少女只要进行战斗]@[textBlack:就会被关进][textYellow:心魔][textBlack:的结界]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102801/vo_full_102801-1-3"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:都是出于][textYellow:心魔]@[textBlack:想让强大的魔法少女自相残杀的恶意。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102801/vo_full_102801-1-3b"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:虽然这件事让我们瞥见了]@[textBlack:魔法少女们放弃争夺][textYellow:心魔][textBlack:石的战斗]@[textBlack:转而与共同的敌人战斗的希望之光，]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102801/vo_full_102801-1-4"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:但获得了四块][textYellow:心魔][textBlack:石]@[textBlack:感受到了支配感的红晴小姐并没有受到触动，]@[textBlack:这场争斗仍然没能闭幕。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102801/vo_full_102801-1-5"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:接下来我要记录的就是]@[textBlack:PROMISED BLOOD的结局]@[textBlack:和围绕此事行动着的魔法少女们的样子。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102801/vo_full_102801-1-6"
      },
      {
